  "conclusion": "Seven input bits per active feature are required before fixed-point classification disagreement falls below the observed noiseless MLAE RMSE. The resulting structured response-surface oracle uses 99 logical qubits before state preparation and remains a lower bound because the correlated empirical-copula loader is excluded.",
